    name: "Menu dropdown",
    zh: "菜单下拉",
    cls: "t-dropdown",
    when: "Contextual menus, dropdowns, popovers — anything that opens from a trigger and should visually grow from that trigger's position. Origin-aware via `data-origin` (top-left, top-cent",
